{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061137/block/singleImage/3253223/df/01M659HJ3XDC47S94MNHMHPEWK.png?updatedAt=1793326650\"/><figcaption>土瓜灣譚公道50號德勝大廈有人墮樓（Google Map/資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>土瓜灣有人墮樓。今日（30日）清晨近5時，有市民報案，指一名男子懷疑從譚公道50號德勝大廈高處墮下，倒臥大廈3樓平台。 救援人員接報到場，將仍有知覺的男子送往伊利沙伯醫院進行治理，警方正調查事件。據了解，54歲事主為上址保安員，墮下時懷疑壓毀大廈13樓外牆水管，導致水花濺出。現場消息指，懷疑保安員在天台現察爆水喉情況時，不慎墮樓，跌到3樓平台，幸期間跌中簷篷卸力救回一命。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:56.193897+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:17:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.774817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:22.290064+00:00","content_hash":"83f0448e8d110f29fd2723536575723981516715fb2f06eb65a61b117198208b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:56.193897+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}